# Final Product Acceptance — one-time run trigger

This file exists ONLY as the `paths:` trigger for
`.github/workflows/final-product-acceptance.yml`.

It was committed in the triggering commit so that pushing the acceptance
branch runs the acceptance workflow exactly once. It carries no product
content and no configuration.

Cleanup order (deliberately NOT done in the triggering session):

1. Remove the `push:` trigger from the workflow, leaving this marker file
   unchanged, and push. Confirm that no new run starts.
2. Then delete this marker file in a separate commit.
3. `workflow_dispatch` is retained so acceptance can always be re-run
   deliberately.
